<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FelCor Suite restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FelCor Suite restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it restarted coverage of FelCor Suite Hotels Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- FelCor gained 1/8 to 35-1/2 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
